basic.description:
{Basic Gating}

Grants the ability to gate Imps, Gogs, and Hell Hounds.

{H6 Gating}
H6 Inferno units build Gating charge when attacking (max 400); the hero can cast Gating I and II (no Spell Book needed). Only affects H6 Inferno units.

advanced.description:
{Advanced Gating}

Grants the ability to gate Demons, Pit Fiends, and Succubi in addition to previous creatures.

{H6 Gating}
H6 Inferno units build Gating charge when attacking (max 400); the hero can cast Gating I, II, and III (no Spell Book needed). Only affects H6 Inferno units.

expert.description:
{Expert Gating}

Grants the ability to gate Efreet, Hell Steeds, and Devils in addition to previous creatures.

{H6 Gating}
H6 Inferno units build Gating charge when attacking (max 400); the hero can cast Gating I, II, III, and IV (no Spell Book needed). Only affects H6 Inferno units.

